You are wearing an amulet, a hooded robe, and your wedding ring, and holding an asymmetrical crystal, a needle, a screwdriver, and a tarnished bronze key.

Overhead, the clouds flicker in a greenish haze of sheet lightning.

Another bolt of lightning strobes across the roiling clouds.

